// This is a regression test for a hang discovered by the fuzzer. Previously
// this took minutes even in release mode, because it builds up closures whose
// captured environments grow exponentially. But because they all reference the
// same Rc, a comparison that short-circuits on pointer equality completes much
// faster, so now this case no longer hangs.
let f = (f, x) => f(f, {for k, v in std: () => x});
f(f, 2)

